{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34381","headline":"润州江口送人谒池阳卫郎中 · 陆龟蒙","name":"润州江口送人谒池阳卫郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山翁曾约旧交欢，须拂侯门侧注冠。\n月在石头摇戍角，风生江口亚帆竿。\n闲随野醉溪声闹，独伴清谭晓色残。\n待取新秋归更好，九华苍翠入楼寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}